{"candidateAnswer":"2 times","evidence":"[D14:1 | 5:44 pm on 3 June, 2022] Joanna: Nate, after finishing my screenplay I got a rejection letter from a major company. It really bummed me out.\n[D24:12 | 2:01 pm on 21 October, 2022] Joanna: Well, I had a bit of a setback recently - another rejection from a production company.","itemId":"urn:uuid:bf686ff1-9972-5c84-8f47-d41458f19b43","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:7b5eeec0afaac5c1833fcd742e76383e488af273597f68b75b6e29f208b77397","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many times has Joanna's scripts been rejected?","referenceAnswer":"Twice","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"7b5eeec0afaac5c1833fcd742e76383e488af273597f68b75b6e29f208b77397"}}]}